        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn RTQBI, Single Cylinder Heart Mortise Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBring old world style to your home with the Heart Single Cylinder Mortise Deadbolt. The rough black finish mimics the texture of naturally weathered iron for an authentic look; and it is backed by a lifetime finish warranty. It will fit door thicknesses ranging from 1-3/4” to 2-1/8”. Available with a 2-3/4\" or 2-1/2\" backset. A single cylinder lock, the deadbolt is operated by thumbpiece from the inside and by key from the outside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Heart Single Cylinder Mortise Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Rough Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Cylinder Collar Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder Collar Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 1-3/4” to 2-1/8”</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\" or 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Lock Front Height: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Lock Front Width: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumbturn spindle and tail pieces are 1-1/2” long with 3/16” diamond.</li>\r\n<li>Schlage “C” keyway.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime no rust warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> A key operates the deadbolt from the exterior while a thumbturn operates it from the interior.\r\n</p>",
